      "review_summary": "The PR replaces usage-bar translator prototype-chain membership checks with own-property checks and adds regression coverage for prototype-key alias and map lookups.\n\nPR surface: Source 0, Tests +25. Total +25 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source inspection of current main and v2026.6.11 shows prototype-chain in checks on custom alias and map case tables, so a key such as toString or constructor can take the wrong lookup path.",
